$music_separation — split music into stems (BS-RoFormer or HTDemucs v4)



SUMMARY

  Separates each sound in sounds[] into stems using one of:

  • bs_roformer_sw (default) — BS-RoFormer-SW by jarredou, 6-stem (vocals, drums,
    bass, guitar, piano, other). Best general-purpose quality.

  • bs_roformer_viperx_1297 — BS-RoFormer-Viperx-1297 via python-audio-separator
    (vocals, instrumental). Place BS-RoFormer-Viperx-1297.ckpt in models/roformer/
    or use model_path=.

  • htdemucs_v4 — Intel HTDemucs v4 OpenVINO IR (drums, bass, other, vocals).
    Same model as openvino-plugins-ai-audacity; RoFormer variants usually sound better.



SYNTAX

  $music_separation
  $music_separation(model=bs_roformer_sw)
  $music_separation(model=@models)
  $music_separation(model=htdemucs_v4, device=CPU, shifts=2)
  $music_separation(model=bs_roformer_viperx_1297)
  $music_separation(model=2stem, model_path='models/roformer/my.ckpt')



INPUT

  sounds[] — required; WAV/MP3/etc. (decoded via soundfile or ffmpeg).



OUTPUT

  sounds[] — one WAV link per stem per input, in model stem order.



ARGUMENTS

  model= — bs_roformer_sw (default), bs_roformer_viperx_1297 / 2stem, htdemucs_v4 / 4stem.
           Use model=@instruction to run each entry from that instruction's texts[] ($list).

  model_path= — optional local .ckpt for RoFormer variants.

  device= — OpenVINO device for HTDemucs (default CPU).

  shifts= — random-shift ensembling for HTDemucs (default 2).



BEHAVIOR

  RoFormer: download checkpoints via audio-separator → models/roformer/,
  PyTorch inference (GPU recommended).

  HTDemucs: download Intel/demucs-openvino → models/demucs-openvino/htdemucs_v4/,
  torch STFT + OpenVINO inference with overlap-add (matches Audacity reference).



REQUIREMENTS

  Runs in .venvs/media (torch + openvino + audio-separator).
  Setup: powershell -File tools\setup_external_venvs.ps1



ENVIRONMENT

  AH_EMULATE_MUSIC_SEPARATION=1 — stub WAV text files without models.

  OPENVINO_CACHE_DIR — HTDemucs compiled-model cache.

  AUDIO_SEPARATOR_MODEL_DIR — RoFormer checkpoint dir (default models/roformer/).



EXAMPLE

  @stems: @track -> $music_separation
  @vocals: @track -> $music_separation(model=2stem)
  @classic: @track -> $music_separation(model=htdemucs_v4, shifts=5)



PROMPT-CONSUMING

  No.
